==Description==
The '''Northstar Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 31 of the premium [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|1,070}} or {{Robux|92}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|15,580}} or {{Robux|3,272}}.

The '''Northstar Nametag''' has dark blue, blue to dark blue gradient text with a dark blue outline. Behind the text there is a blue north star and purple mist.

